         <pdf:Producer>Acrobat Distiller 19.0 (Windows)</pdf:Producer>
         <pdf:Keywords>Description&#xD;&#xA;SUPERFET III MOSFET is ON Semiconductorâ€™s brandâˆ’new high&#xD;&#xA;voltage superâˆ’junction (SJ) MOSFET family that is utilizing charge&#xD;&#xA;balance technology for outstanding low onâˆ’resistance and lower gate&#xD;&#xA;charge performance. This advanced technology is tailored to minimize&#xD;&#xA;conduction loss, provide superior switching performance, and&#xD;&#xA;withstand extreme dv/dt rate.&#xD;&#xA;Consequently, SUPERFET III MOSFET is very suitable for the&#xD;&#xA;various power system for miniaturization and higher efficiency.&#xD;&#xA;SUPERFET III FRFET MOSFETâ€™s optimized reverse recovery&#xD;&#xA;performance of body diode can remove additional component and&#xD;&#xA;improve system reliability.</pdf:Keywords>
         <xmp:CreatorTool>BroadVision, Inc.</xmp:CreatorTool>
         <xmp:ModifyDate>2020-09-14T14:27:53+02:00</xmp:ModifyDate>
